{
  "name": "AulaCash — Confirmación cambio de contraseña",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configuración requerida\n\n**1. Credencial SMTP**\nConectá el nodo \"Enviar email\" con tus credenciales SMTP (Gmail, Resend SMTP, Brevo, etc.).\n\n**2. URL del Webhook**\nCopiá la URL de producción del nodo \"Recibir solicitud\" y pegala en la variable de entorno del backend:\n```\nN8N_CAMBIO_PASSWORD_WEBHOOK=https://tu-n8n.com/webhook/aulacash-cambio-password\n```\n\n**3. Payload esperado del backend**\n```json\n{\n  \"email\": \"usuario@ejemplo.com\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Juan\",\n  \"apellido\": \"García\"\n}\n```",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Instrucciones de configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "aulacash-cambio-password",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Recibir solicitud",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 380],
      "webhookId": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000099"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.item.json.body;\nconst nombre = body.nombre || 'Usuario';\nconst apellido = body.apellido || '';\nconst email = body.email;\n\nconst ahora = $now;\nconst fecha = ahora.toFormat('dd/MM/yyyy');\nconst hora = ahora.toFormat('HH:mm');\nconst anio = ahora.year;\n\nconst html = `<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Contraseña actualizada — AulaCash</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f3f3f3;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#f3f3f3;padding:32px 16px\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:480px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)\">\n\n          <!-- Header azul -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color:#009ee3;padding:36px 32px 28px;text-align:center\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding-bottom:16px\">\n                    <div style=\"display:inline-block;width:64px;height:64px;background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);border-radius:50%;line-height:64px;text-align:center;font-size:30px\">&#128274;</div>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\">\n                    <h1 style=\"margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.3px\">Contraseña actualizada</h1>\n                    <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);font-size:13px\">AulaCash &middot; Simulaci&oacute;n educativa</p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Cuerpo -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:32px\">\n\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#1a1c1c;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\">\n                Hola, <strong style=\"font-weight:700\">${nombre} ${apellido}</strong>\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 24px;color:#5f5e5e;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6\">\n                Tu contrase&ntilde;a en <strong style=\"color:#009ee3\">AulaCash</strong> fue actualizada correctamente\n                el <strong>${fecha}</strong> a las <strong>${hora} hs</strong>.\n              </p>\n\n              <!-- Caja verde: éxito -->\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"background-color:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #2e7d32;border-radius:8px;padding:16px\">\n                    <p style=\"margin:0;color:#1b5e20;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">&check; Cambio exitoso</p>\n                    <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;color:#2e7d32;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5\">\n                      Pod&eacute;s seguir usando AulaCash normalmente con tu nueva contrase&ntilde;a.\n                    </p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n\n              <!-- Caja naranja: advertencia -->\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"background-color:#fff8e1;border-left:4px solid #f57c00;border-radius:8px;padding:16px\">\n                    <p style=\"margin:0;color:#e65100;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">&#9888; &iquest;No realizaste este cambio?</p>\n                    <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;color:#bf360c;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5\">\n                      Si no fuiste vos, contact&aacute; con tu docente o administrador de AulaCash\n                      inmediatamente para que bloqueen tu cuenta.\n                    </p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n\n              <p style=\"margin:0;color:#bec8d2;font-size:12px;text-align:center;line-height:1.7\">\n                Este es un mensaje autom&aacute;tico, por favor no respondas este correo.<br>\n                AulaCash &middot; Simulaci&oacute;n educativa &middot; Los saldos no representan dinero real.\n              </p>\n\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color:#f3f3f3;padding:16px 32px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid #eeeeee\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0;color:#6e7881;font-size:12px\">\n                AulaCash &copy; ${anio}\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { email, nombre, apellido, html } }];"
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000003",
